# Repo only files at this package root, kept out of the home directory. The manifest is this
# module's contract with the layer above, so it belongs to the repository rather than to the
# running configuration. The guide is for a person and for Claude working in this repository,
# and stowed it would land as ~/AGENTS.md, which is what happened on the dry run that added
# this line.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
DEPENDENCIES
# The map and the emitter are this module's half of the theme contract, read by
# src/check-theme.sh and by nothing Ghostty loads.
theme-map
theme-emit
# The shadow declaration is read by the stow step one layer up and the probe by the
# reconciler, so both belong to the repository rather than to the running configuration.
SHADOW-PATHS
config-probe
